<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<templates xml:space="preserve">
  <t t-name="pb_hiring.Connections">
    <div class="pb-hiring-connect">
      <header class="hc-header">
        <div><span class="hc-eyebrow" t-esc="state.company"/><h1 t-esc="state.boardsOnly ? 'Connect your job boards' : 'Hiring connections'"/><p>Connect your company once. Your recruiters can then publish from Hiring.</p></div>
        <button t-if="state.boardsOnly" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" t-on-click="openBoards">Back to job boards</button><button t-else="" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" t-on-click="back">Back to hiring setup</button>
      </header>
      <div t-if="state.error" class="alert alert-danger" role="alert" t-esc="state.error"/>
      <div class="hc-grid">
        <section t-foreach="cards" t-as="card" t-key="card.key" class="hc-card">
          <div class="hc-card-top"><span class="hc-mark" t-att-class="{'has-logo':boardLogo(card.key)}"><img t-if="boardLogo(card.key)" t-att-src="boardLogo(card.key)" t-att-alt="card.title + ' logo'" width="34" height="34" decoding="async"/><t t-else="" t-esc="card.title.slice(0,1)"/></span><span class="hc-status" t-att-class="{'hc-on': card.enabled}" t-esc="card.status"/></div>
          <h2 t-esc="card.title"/><p t-esc="card.description"/>
          <small t-if="card.checked_at">Last checked <t t-esc="card.checked_at"/> UTC</small>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" t-on-click="() => this.select(card)"><t t-if="card.check_ok">Manage connection</t><t t-else="">Set up connection</t><span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></button>
        </section>
      </div>
      <section t-if="!state.boardsOnly" class="hc-native">
        <div><span class="hc-eyebrow">Your hiring rules</span><h2>Keep the decisions in Payobook</h2><p>Choose who sees what, who approves cover and how an offer’s employer cost is calculated.</p></div>
        <div class="hc-native-actions">
          <button class="btn btn-outline-primary" t-on-click="() => this.openAction('pb_hiring.action_visibility_policy')">Stage visibility</button>
          <button class="btn btn-outline-primary" t-on-click="() => this.openAction('pb_hiring.action_pb_hiring_country_rule')">Cover approvers</button>
          <button class="btn btn-outline-primary" t-on-click="() => this.openAction('pb_hiring.action_offer_cost_profile')">Country offer setup</button>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="hc-board-note"><h2>Job boards</h2><p>Careers applications, referrals and agency submissions already arrive in Payobook. LinkedIn and JobStreet have API publishing and signed application intake workflows. Provider approval and acceptance testing are required before live use. VietnamWorks needs its current API contract before its connector can be completed. Tracked links and posting packs remain available.</p></section>
      <div t-if="state.selected" class="hc-overlay" t-on-keydown="onDialogKey">
        <section class="hc-wizard" t-ref="dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="hc-title">
          <header><div><span class="hc-eyebrow">Connection guide</span><h2 id="hc-title" t-esc="state.selected.title"/></div><button class="btn btn-light" aria-label="Close" t-on-click="close" t-att-disabled="state.busy">×</button></header>
          <ol class="hc-steps"><li t-foreach="steps" t-as="step" t-key="step" t-att-class="{'current': state.step === step_index, 'done': state.step > step_index}"><span t-esc="step_index + 1"/><t t-esc="step"/></li></ol>
          <div class="hc-wizard-body">
            <div t-if="state.error" class="alert alert-danger" role="alert" t-esc="state.error"/>
            <t t-if="state.step === 0 and !isBoard"><h3>What this makes possible</h3><p class="hc-intro" t-esc="state.selected.description"/><div class="hc-help"><b>Before you start</b><p t-esc="state.selected.help"/></div></t>
            <t t-if="state.step === 0 and isBoard">
              <h3>Connect once. Recruit from one place.</h3><p>Jobs belong to your company on the board. Applications come back to your company in Payobook.</p>
              <div class="hc-ownership"><section><span class="hc-eyebrow">Payobook handles</span><h4>The integration</h4><p>Partner approval, the shared developer app, secure credentials and technical testing.</p></section><section><span class="hc-eyebrow">You handle</span><h4>Your company</h4><p>Identify your employer account, complete the provider’s customer authorization and choose when recruiters can use it.</p></section></div>
              <div class="hc-help"><b>You do not need to create a developer app</b><p>Your account stays separate from every other Payobook customer. Your recruiters will use Job boards to prepare adverts and follow applications.</p></div>
              <div t-if="state.selected.key === 'vietnamworks'" class="hc-result"><b>Manual posting is available</b><p>Automatic publishing needs VietnamWorks provider access and a completed connector. Use a tracked application link while Payobook arranges this.</p></div>
            </t>
            <t t-if="state.step === 1">
              <t t-if="isBoard"><h3>Which company are you connecting?</h3><p>Use your tenant’s employer account. For example, Rize connects its own LinkedIn company page.</p><div t-if="state.selected.key === 'linkedin'" class="hc-help"><b>Find your LinkedIn company ID</b><p>Open your company’s admin page in LinkedIn. Copy the number after /company/, or paste that full admin page URL below.</p></div><div t-if="state.selected.key === 'seek'" class="hc-help"><b>Use your employer account ID</b><p>Your SEEK / JobStreet account contact can supply this. Payobook configures the partner credentials.</p></div></t><p t-else="" t-esc="state.selected.help"/>
              <label t-foreach="setupFields" t-as="fld" t-key="fld.key" class="hc-field"><span t-esc="fieldLabel(fld)"/><select t-if="state.selected.key === 'docusign' and fld.key === 'environment'" class="form-control" t-model="state.values[fld.key]"><option value="">Choose an environment</option><option value="demo">Demo (test signatures)</option><option value="production">Production</option></select><select t-elif="['linkedin','seek'].includes(state.selected.key) and fld.key === 'environment'" class="form-control" t-model="state.values[fld.key]"><option value="">Choose an environment</option><option t-if="state.selected.key === 'seek'" value="playground">Playground (read-only)</option><option value="test">Provider-approved test resources</option><option value="production">Production</option></select><textarea t-elif="fld.key === 'private_key'" class="form-control" rows="5" t-model="state.values[fld.key]" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" style="-webkit-text-security: disc;" t-att-placeholder="fld.stored ? 'Already stored — leave blank to keep' : 'Paste the PEM private key, including BEGIN and END lines'"/><input t-else="" class="form-control" t-att-type="fld.secret ? 'password' : 'text'" t-model="state.values[fld.key]" autocomplete="off" t-att-placeholder="fld.stored ? 'Already stored — leave blank to keep' : ''"/><small t-if="fld.secret">Stored securely. The saved value is never displayed.</small></label>
              <button t-if="isBoard and state.selected.fields.length" class="hc-advanced btn btn-link" t-on-click="() => { this.state.advanced=!this.state.advanced; }" t-esc="state.advanced ? 'Hide technical settings' : 'Technical settings · for your implementation team'"/>
              <p t-if="isBoard and state.advanced">Only use credentials approved for this tenant. Keep the shared Payobook partner secret on the server.</p>
              <div t-if="!state.selected.fields.length and state.selected.key !== 'vietnamworks'" class="hc-help">Use the existing Calendar or Email settings to authorise the account, then check the connection here. Your administrator supplies the application credentials; organisers connect their own calendars.</div>
            </t>
            <t t-if="state.step === 2"><h3 t-esc="isBoard ? 'Your connection readiness' : 'Check before switching on'"/>
              <t t-if="isBoard"><div class="hc-readiness"><div><span>1</span><div><b>Your company details</b><p>Saved for <t t-esc="state.company"/>.</p></div><strong>Saved</strong></div><div><span>2</span><div><b>Payobook partner access</b><p t-esc="state.selected.platform_note || 'Automatic publishing is not available for this board yet.'"/></div><strong t-if="state.selected.platform_ready">Ready</strong><strong t-else="">Payobook action</strong></div><div><span>3</span><div><b>Customer authorization and test</b><p>Payobook helps verify your board account, customer authorization and a test job with an incoming application before live use.</p></div><strong t-esc="state.selected.check_ok ? 'Access checked' : 'Next'"/></div></div><p t-if="!state.selected.platform_ready">You can leave this guide now and post manually. Your details are saved; no job will be sent by completing setup.</p><button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" t-on-click="reloadSelection" t-att-disabled="state.busy">Refresh readiness</button></t><div t-if="state.selected.platform_managed and state.advanced" class="hc-help"><b>Payobook shared partner app</b><p>Tenant reference: <code t-esc="state.selected.tenant_reference"/>. Payobook authorizes this tenant centrally; other tenants cannot use its board account.</p><p t-if="state.selected.provision_note" t-esc="state.selected.provision_note"/></div><p>The check reads the connection. It does not send an offer or message to a candidate.</p><div class="hc-result" t-att-class="{'passed': state.selected.check_ok}" role="status"><b t-esc="state.selected.check_ok ? 'Connection check passed' : 'Next action'"/><p t-esc="state.selected.note || 'Run the check to see what is ready and what still needs attention.'"/></div><div t-if="['docusign','documenso','whatsapp'].includes(state.selected.key) or (isBoard and state.advanced)" class="hc-help"><b>Provider webhook address</b><p>Register this address with the provider using its matching signing secret. For DocuSign enable Connect HMAC; new envelopes include the callback. For SEEK subscribe to CandidateApplicationCreated for the configured hirer.</p><code t-esc="state.selected.callback"/></div></t>
            <t t-if="state.step === 3"><h3 t-esc="state.selected.enabled ? 'Connection enabled' : 'Connection paused'"/><p t-esc="state.selected.note"/><p>Complete a controlled end-to-end test before using this with real candidates.</p><button t-if="isBoard" class="btn btn-outline-primary" t-on-click="openBoards">Go to job boards →</button></t>
          </div>
          <footer><button t-if="state.step > 0 and state.step &lt; 3" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" t-on-click="() => this.state.step--" t-att-disabled="state.busy">Back</button><span class="hc-grow"/><span t-if="state.busy" role="status">Working…</span><button t-if="state.step === 0" class="btn btn-primary" t-on-click="() => this.state.step = 1">Get started →</button><button t-if="state.step === 1" class="btn btn-primary" t-on-click="save" t-att-disabled="state.busy">Save and continue →</button><button t-if="state.step === 2 and canProvision" class="btn btn-outline-primary" t-on-click="provision" t-att-disabled="state.busy">Prepare my company connection</button><button t-if="state.step === 2 and (!isBoard or state.selected.platform_ready)" class="btn btn-outline-primary" t-on-click="check" t-att-disabled="state.busy">Run connection check</button><button t-if="state.step === 2 and state.selected.check_ok" class="btn btn-primary" t-on-click="enable" t-att-disabled="state.busy"><t t-if="state.selected.enabled">Pause connection</t><t t-else="">Enable connection →</t></button><button t-if="state.step === 2 and isBoard and !state.selected.platform_ready" class="btn btn-primary" t-on-click="close">Save and finish later</button><button t-if="state.step === 3" class="btn btn-primary" t-on-click="close">Done</button></footer>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </t>
</templates>
